{"sourceUrl":"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/info/1018/28821.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:27.777556+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/info/1018/28821.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<div><p><strong><span><span>厦门大学电子科学与技术学院</span>2025<span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>指南</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>为促进全国各高校之间优秀大学生的交流与沟通，增进优秀大学生对厦门大学电子科学与技术学院（国家示范性微电子学院）的了解，激发优秀学子的科研兴趣，厦门大学电子科学与技术学院启动</span><span>“2025</span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动（以下简称夏令营）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>一、申请条件</span> </span></p><p><span>1. <span>本科在校三年级学生（即</span><span>2026</span><span>年应届本科毕业生）。</span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span><span><span>具有坚定的社会主义理想信念，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理的行为。</span></span><strong></strong></p><p><span>2. <span>学习成绩优秀，对本领域的科学研究有着浓厚兴趣，具有潜在的科研能力。</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>英语水平良好，全国大学英语四级考试成绩达到</span><span>425</span><span>分及以上，或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GMAT</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>任一项考试成绩达到总分的</span><span>60%</span><span>及以上。</span></span></p><p><span>4. <span>申请专业要求：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）申请电子工程系：物理电子学、电路与系统、微电子与固体电子学、电磁场与微波技术、电子信息、集成电路、光电工程学科，以及有志于从事电子</span></span><span><span>和集成电路</span></span><span><span>的其它理工科，如数学、物理、化学、材料等学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）申请电子科学系：物理电子学、无线电物理、电磁场与微波技术、电子信息、半导体照明与显示、生物医学工程等专业相关学科，以及有志于从事电子</span></span><span><span>和集成电路</span></span><span><span>的其它理工科，如人工智能、数学、物理、化学、材料、计算机及软件类、统计类等学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）申请微电子与集成电路系：物理电子学、电路与系统、微电子与固体电子学、电磁场与微波技术、电子信息、集成电路、光电工程学科，以及有志于从事</span></span><span><span>电子</span></span><span><span>和集成电路</span></span><span><span>的其它理工科，如数学、物理、化学、材料等学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）</span></span><span><span>申请电磁声学研究院：无线电物理、电磁场与微波技术、电子信息、集成电路、光电</span>(<span>学</span><span>)</span><span>工程等专业相关学科，以及有志于从事电子</span></span><span><span>和集成电路</span></span><span><span>的其它理工科，如人工智能、生物医学工程、数学、物理、分析化学、材料等学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）申请国家集成电路产教融合创新平台：集成电路、电路与系统、微电子与固体电子学、电子信息、物理电子学、电磁场与微波技术、光电工程学科，以及有志于从事电子和集成电路的其它理工科，如物理、化学、材料等学科。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、申请</span></span><span><span>步骤</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>查看意向导师</span></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营导师信息具体可查看我院网站（</span></span><span>https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/szdw.htm</span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>系统报名</span></span></p><p><span>1. <span>网上报名时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>即日起</span></span></strong><strong><span>-6<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>24</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17:30</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span><strong></strong></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>报名系统：</span> https://dxsxly.xmu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>申请人请将以下材料按顺序扫描后</span><span>(</span><span>要求彩色扫描 </span><span>)</span><span>合并成一个 </span><span>PDF </span><span>文档</span><span>,</span><span>通过报名系统上传</span><span>,</span><span>命名格式为</span><span>:</span><span>报名编号</span><span>(</span><span>报名后系统生成</span><span>)-</span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>，并</span></span><span><span>保证清晰不影响阅读。纸质版材料不需要寄送，自己留底。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）夏令营申请表：通过报名系统生成，所在高校意见、所在教务部门意见处需签字盖章、本人承诺处需签字。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）个人陈述：模板见附件，可打印，但是考生签名处需手写签名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）正式成绩单：大一、二、三年级成绩，须为加盖所在学校教务部门公章。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）英语四级或六级成绩单或其他英语成绩证明材料：成绩单可直接扫描；</span></span><span><span>如果不能提供</span></span><span><span>成绩单，提供成绩证明须加盖就读学院公章。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）</span></span><strong><span><span>两位副教授</span></span></strong><span><span>及其以上专家的推荐信：模板见附件，可打印，但是推荐人签字处需手写签名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>6<span>）获奖（资格）证书复印件或个人代表作品</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非必须</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>7<span>）公开发表的论文</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>非必须</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>8<span>）身份证正反面。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>9<span>）学生证正反面。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、</span></span><span><span>入营</span></span><span><span>选拔</span></span></p><p><span><span>院系成立材料审查组，根据综合评价结果择优确定入营名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院</span><span>e-mail</span><span>通知被接收为我院夏令营营员的同学。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、时间安排</span></span></p><div><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>时间安排</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>事项</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>17:30</span><span>前</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>系统报名</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>底</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>确定并通知入选营员</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7<span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>报到</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7<span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>上午</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>开幕式</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日下午</span><span>-</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>日上午</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>到意向导师课题组参加科研实践</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7<span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>下午</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>闭营</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、其他说明</span></span></p><p><span>1. <span>申请人提供</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>必须</span></span><span><span>真实有效</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>我院有</span><span>5</span><span>个单位：电子工程系、电子科学系、微电子与集成电路系、电磁声学研究院、国家集成电路产教融合创新平台。</span></span><strong><span><span>报名后不接受跨</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>单位</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>调剂。</span> </span></strong></p><p><span>3. <span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守厦门大学的相关规定，按照我院的统一安排参加相关活动，请勿私自外出活动。严禁擅自离队和下水游泳，如有意外，后果自负。</span><span> </span></span></p><p><span>4. <span>夏令营期间，我院安排外校营员入住翔安校区学生公寓，将给营员发放校园卡，校园卡会存</span><span>100</span><span>元饭补。</span></span></p><p><span>5. <span>参加夏令营的同学，如果乘坐火车，请保留火车票；如果乘坐飞机，请打印行程单、保留登机牌、支付记录等。</span></span><span><span>后续如录取为我院</span><span>2026</span><span>级研究生，可按火车硬座票标准补贴往返此次夏令营活动的路费</span></span><span><span>（最多</span>400<span>元）。</span></span></p><p><span>6. </span><span><span>如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策等，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，我院将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>厦门大学电子科学与技术学院</span></span><span><span>王老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span>0592-2181859</span></p><p><span>E-mail<span>：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:esezs@xmu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>esezs@xmu.edu.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span><span>学院网址：</span><a href=\"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/index.htm</a> </span></p><p><br/></p><p> <span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1504263538&amp;wbfileid=C7C85E5038229261459E216182571126\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">厦门大学研究生专家推荐信.doc</a></span></p><p> <span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ese.xmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1504263538&amp;wbfileid=4DB1201AED59E765EA4E93010389DBFC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">厦门大学202X年研究生考生自述表.doc</a></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>厦门大学电子科学与技术学院</span></span></p><p><span>2025<span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"4bb7b8e9e1334af832569e6af5ec7e9e751939e98b0fb2bafee1911f6a570c93","textLength":2068,"sourceSha256":"43da954688e8e732f369c3ee2f4d2652a4510f95569a93ed40b24c03be0ce0c0","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ab79c56dafb52cb56858","title":"2025年厦门大学电子科学与技术学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名指南","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:27.777556+00:00"}
